  "description": "Kaiser, the player once known as “The God” for dominating the number one spot on the rankings, has returned. The virtual reality game “God of Savior.” And the game that inspired it, “Demrock.” Kaiser, the player who once dominated the top spot and was known as “The God.” But he vanished without a word— and a year and six months have passed. And now, he attempts to log in once more. \n\n*“Would you like to log in to the game?”*\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
